# Serena MCP tool cache
.serena/

# The private pages and the vault built from them. Both are deliberately
# absent from this repository: `private/` holds the plaintext you edit, and
# `web/vault.json` is the encrypted blob `tool/vault.js` produces from it and
# the build copies to the site root. Neither belongs in a public history.
private/
web/vault.json
